alpha[i]<-rnorm(1,mean=0,sd=1)

accept.prob<- dgamma(alpha[i],beta[i],x)/dgamma(alpha[i-1],beta[i],x)

if (runif(1)<accept.prob)

alpha[i]
else
alpha[i-1]
accept<-accept+1

draws[i,1]<-beta[i]
draws[i,2]<-alpha[i]
}
# End MCMC Loop
}

The data comes from a life time (in days) from some microorganisms.
I hope someone have a better idea, from me.
Thank you all!

